{"step_index":292,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T05:39:56Z","input_tokens":2684,"cache_read_tokens":180295,"output_tokens":11229,"thinking":"Rebuilding the scripts from scratch, removing all references to the \"Compilación\" step. This necessitates a complete redesign to achieve the desired functionality without the problematic compilation component. The goal is a clean, efficient script that avoids the previous issue entirely.\n\n\nInitial concern centers on how the system handles multi-channel monitoring in `PID_4EE1` (MTP) with a USB drive. The system actively monitors four external jump channels every 200ms. Examining channel A, the recovery menu jump is triggered by USB presence and external reset, capturing `PID_4EE7` (fastbootd) to bypass the device into the bootloader, disabling the watchdog, unlocking the bootloader, and enabling `otg_device=1` for Android 12 flashing.\n\n\nAnalysis reveals three distinct jump scenarios for system access. The first uses a reset trigger with power-on, executing commands to disable watchdog, unlock the bootloader, enable USB OTG, and enter fastboot. The second immediately jumps to U-Boot fastboot mode, executing similar unlocking and flashing commands, protecting specific image files. The final path leverages ADB, installing and removing specific applications, and injecting a token.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"# ==============================================================================\n# MOTOR PRINCIPAL: PROGRAMA PERFECTO XVIEW+ (ZTE ZXV10 B866V2 - S905X2 G12A)\n# Fusion integral de todas las herramientas de la memoria USB + hallazgos REA\n# Reglas absolutas:\n#   1. 100% Externo (Cero tornillos, Cero TTL)\n#   2. Proteccion total de factory.img (Widevine L1) y cri_data.img (MAC/Serie)\n#   3. Salto directo del bloqueo QR RSA-2048 de ZTE mediante programas integrados\n#      (Recovery fastbootd PID_4EE7 / U-Boot Fastboot PID_0D02 / WorldCup VID_1B8E / QADEBUG)\n# ==============================================================================\n\n[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Continue\"\n\n$ROOT_DIR   = Split-Path -Parent $PSScriptRoot\n$MOTOR_DIR  = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR\"\n$APKS_DIR   = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV\"\n$KEYS_DIR   = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"3_LLAVES_USB_PARA_LA_CAJA\"\n$DRV_DIR    = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"4_DRIVERS_Y_GUI_WINDOWS\"\n$FW_DIR     = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"5_FIRMWARE_SEGURO_B866V2\"\n\n$ADB        = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"adb.exe\"\n$FASTBOOT   = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"fastboot_moderno.exe\"\nif (-not (Test-Path $FASTBOOT)) { $FASTBOOT = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"fastboot.exe\" }\n$ADNL       = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"adnl.exe\"\n$UPDATE     = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"update.exe\"\n\n$Global:ADB_TARGET_ARGS = @()\n$Global:CONNECTED_IP    = \"\"\n\nfunction Invoke-Adb {\n    param([string[]]$Arguments)\n    $allArgs = @()\n    if ($Global:ADB_TARGET_ARGS.Count -gt 0) { $allArgs += $Global:ADB_TARGET_ARGS }\n    $allArgs += $Arguments\n    & $ADB @allArgs\n}\n\nfunction Get-BoxConnectionState {\n    $state = [ordered]@{\n        UsbHardwareMode = \"Ninguno detectado por cable USB directo\"\n        SerialNumber    = \"No detectado\"\n        RawPid          = \"\"\n        AdbDevices      = @()\n        FastbootDevices = @()\n    }\n\n    try {\n        $pnp = Get-CimInstance Win32_PnPEntity -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object {\n            $_.DeviceID -match \"VID_18D1|VID_19D2|VID_1B8E\"\n        }\n        foreach ($dev in $pnp) {\n            if ($dev.DeviceID -match \"\\\\([^\\\\]+)$\") {\n                $sn = $Matches[1]\n                if ($sn -notmatch \"&\") { $state.SerialNumber = $sn }\n            }\n            if ($dev.DeviceID -match \"PID_4EE2\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"ADB USB Activo (PID_4EE2) - LISTO PARA LIBERACION DIRECTA\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"4EE2\"\n            }\n            elseif ($dev.DeviceID -match \"PID_4EE7\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Recovery Fastbootd (PID_4EE7) - LISTO PARA SALTO A BOOTLOADER\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"4EE7\"\n            }\n            elseif ($dev.DeviceID -match \"PID_0D02\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"U-Boot Fastboot Bootloader (PID_0D02) - LISTO PARA FLASHEO\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"0D02\"\n            }\n            elseif ($dev.DeviceID -match \"PID_4EE1\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Modo MTP Android (PID_4EE1) - Usa Opcion 1 para Salto por Recovery/WorldCup\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"4EE1\"\n            }\n            elseif ($dev.DeviceID -match \"VID_1B8E\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Amlogic WorldCup / DNL Mode (VID_1B8E) - LISTO PARA DESBLOQUEO U-BOOT\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"1B8E\"\n            }\n        }\n    } catch {}\n\n    if (Test-Path $ADB) {\n        $adbOut = & $ADB devices 2>$null\n        foreach ($line in $adbOut) {\n            if ($line -match \"^(\\S+)\\s+(device|unauthorized|offline)$\") {\n                $state.AdbDevices += \"$($Matches[1]) [$($Matches[2])]\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    if (Test-Path $FASTBOOT) {\n        $fbOut = & $FASTBOOT devices 2>$null\n        foreach ($line in $fbOut) {\n            if ($line -match \"^(\\S+)\\s+fastboot\") {\n                $state.FastbootDevices += $Matches[1]\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    return $state\n}\n\nfunction Show-Banner {\n    Clear-Host\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"          PROGRAMA PERFECTO - MEGACABLE XVIEW+ (ZTE ZXV10 B866V2)               \" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"     Motor de Salto Directo (Recovery Fastbootd / WorldCup / Fastboot / ADB)    \" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"      Regla: 100% Externo Sin Abrir Tornillos | Proteccion Widevine L1/MAC      \" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n\n    $st = Get-BoxConnectionState\n    Write-Host \"\"\n    Write-Host \" [RADAR DE HARDWARE USB EN TIEMPO REAL]\" -ForegroundColor Yellow\n    Write-Host \"  * Caja Detectada   : Xview+ (Serie: $($st.SerialNumber))\" -ForegroundColor White\n    if ($st.RawPid -match \"4EE2|0D02|4EE7|1B8E\") {\n        Write-Host \"  * Estado Cable USB : $($st.UsbHardwareMode)\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    } elseif ($st.RawPid -eq \"4EE1\") {\n        Write-Host \"  * Estado Cable USB : $($st.UsbHardwareMode)\" -ForegroundColor Yellow\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"  * Estado Cable USB : $($st.UsbHardwareMode)\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n    }\n    if ($st.AdbDevices.Count -gt 0) {\n        Write-Host \"  * Sesion ADB       : $($st.AdbDevices -join ', ')\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"  * Sesion ADB       : Sin sesion activa\" -ForegroundColor DarkGray\n    }\n    if ($st.FastbootDevices.Count -gt 0) {\n        Write-Host \"  * Sesion Fastboot  : $($st.FastbootDevices -join ', ')\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"  * Sesion Fastboot  : En espera de salto (Recovery 'Enter fastboot' o RESET)\" -ForegroundColor DarkGray\n    }\n    Write-Host \"--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\" -ForegroundColor DarkCyan\n}\n\nfunction Execute-AdbPayload {\n    Write-Host \"`n[1/7] Inyectando token 'EE@' en /cache/recovery/last_QR (Bypass candado QR ZTE)...\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"echo -n 'EE@' > /cache/recovery/last_QR; rm -f /cache/recovery/last_QR_Time\") 2>$null\n\n    Write-Host \"[2/7] Desactivando bloqueos de Google Play Protect (de 'adb comandos.txt')...\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"settings put global package_verifier_user_consent -1\")\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"settings put global package_verifier_enable 0\")\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"bmgr enable false\")\n\n    Write-Host \"[3/7] Instalando Launchers Offline y Utilidades desde '2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV'...\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    $coreApks = @(\n        @{ File = \"Home_Screen_Launcher_1.1.3.apk\"; Name = \"Home Screen Launcher (Ligero)\" },\n        @{ File = \"TVLauncher_4_GoogleTV.apk\";      Name = \"TVLauncher 4 (Estilo Google TV)\" },\n        @{ File = \"Button_Mapper_Pro_2.54.apk\";     Name = \"Button Mapper Pro v2.54 (Reasignar Boton Home)\" },\n        @{ File = \"autostart.apk\";                  Name = \"AutoStart al encender\" },\n        @{ File = \"Filemanager.apk\";                Name = \"Gestor de Archivos USB\" },\n        @{ File = \"Downloader_2.0.4.apk\";           Name = \"Downloader Android TV\" }\n    )\n    foreach ($item in $coreApks) {\n        $apkPath = Join-Path $APKS_DIR $item.File\n        if (Test-Path $apkPath) {\n            Write-Host \"  -> Instalando $($item.Name)...\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n            Invoke-Adb @(\"install\", \"-r\", \"-g\", $apkPath)\n        }\n    }\n\n    Write-Host \"[4/7] Neutralizando Pantalla Azul Megacable, Core (oom_adj=-14), OTA y candado QR (com.zte.adb)...\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    $bloatPackages = @(\n        \"com.dotscreen.megacable.portal\",\n        \"com.dotscreen.megacable.core\",\n        \"com.dotscreen.megacable.atv\",\n        \"com.expway.ewm.service\",\n        \"com.zte.adb\",\n        \"com.ztestb.LauncherCustomize\",\n        \"com.zte.ums.oes\",\n        \"com.zte.ota\",\n        \"tv.upgrade.service\",\n        \"com.zte.tv.act\",\n        \"com.ztestb.uploaddiagno\",\n        \"com.zte.factorytesttool\",\n        \"com.hmdm.launcher\"\n    )\n    foreach ($pkg in $bloatPackages) {\n        Write-Host \"  -> Neutralizando $pkg ...\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n        Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"cmd appops set $pkg RUN_IN_BACKGROUND ignore; cmd appops set $pkg RUN_ANY_IN_BACKGROUND ignore; am force-stop $pkg; pm disable-user --user 0 $pkg; pm uninstall -k --user 0 $pkg\") 2>$null | Out-Null\n    }\n\n    Write-Host \"[5/7] Configurando el nuevo Launcher como HOME predeterminado y activando Button Mapper...\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"cmd package set-home-activity dev.dworks.apps.alauncher/.Launcher\") 2>$null\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"settings put secure enabled_accessibility_services flar2.homebutton/flar2.homebutton.ButtonMapperService\") 2>$null\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"settings put secure accessibility_enabled 1\") 2>$null\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"am start -a android.intent.action.MAIN -c android.intent.category.HOME\") 2>$null\n\n    Write-Host \"[6/7] Eliminando banner 'No se pudo instalar la actualizacion del sistema'...\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"settings put global ota_disable_automatic_update 1\") 2>$null\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"cmd notification snooze --for 315360000000 '0|com.google.android.gms|1|com.google.android.gms.update.control.NotificationControl|10049'\") 2>$null\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"cmd appops set com.google.android.gms POST_NOTIFICATION ignore\") 2>$null\n\n    Write-Host \"[7/7] Activando Modo Stealth (Ocultar flags ADB manteniendo puerto 5555 activo)...\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"settings put global adb_enabled 0; settings put secure adb_enabled 0; settings put global development_settings_enabled 0; settings put secure development_settings_enabled 0\") 2>$null\n    Invoke-Adb @(\"shell\", \"setprop service.adb.tcp.port 5555; setprop ctl.start adbd\") 2>$null\n\n    Write-Host \"\"\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    Write-Host \" [LISTO!] Caja liberada con exito (Candado QR y Pantalla Azul eliminados).      \" -ForegroundColor Green\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Green\n}\n\nfunction Invoke-AutoMultiChannelJump {\n    Write-Host \"\"\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    Write-Host \"  OPCION 1: CAPTURA Y SALTO AUTOMATICO MULTI-CANAL (SALTA CANDADO QR / AZUL)    \" -ForegroundColor Green\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    Write-Host \"Este modo salta por completo el bloqueo QR de ZTE atrapando la caja en cualquiera\" -ForegroundColor White\n    Write-Host \"de los 4 canales de hardware externos (con tu memoria USB y cable USB conectados):\" -ForegroundColor White\n    Write-Host \"\"\n    Write-Host \"  COMO ACTIVAR EL SALTO EN LA CAJA (SIN ABRIRLA):\" -ForegroundColor Yellow\n    Write-Host \"  1. Con la memoria USB insertada y el cable USB Macho-a-Macho conectado a la PC,\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n    Write-Host \"     desconecta el cable de corriente de la caja.\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n    Write-Host \"  2. Manten presionado el boton fisico externo RESET (con un clip en el orificio)\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n    Write-Host \"     y vuelve a conectar la corriente:\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n    Write-Host \"     -> Si entra a modo WorldCup (VID_1B8E), el programa la desbloquea solo.\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"     -> Si abre el Menu Recovery en la TV, selecciona 'Enter fastboot' y el\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"        programa atrapara fastbootd (PID_4EE7), saltara a Bootloader (PID_0D02),\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"        apagara el Watchdog de 14s y desbloqueara el sistema automaticamente.\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"\"\n    Write-Host \"[*] RADAR MULTI-CANAL ESCUCHANDO EN VIVO (200ms)... (Presiona Ctrl+C para salir)\" -ForegroundColor Green\n\n    while ($true) {\n        $st = Get-BoxConnectionState\n\n        # Canal 1: Amlogic WorldCup / DNL (VID_1B8E por boton RESET)\n        if ($st.RawPid -eq \"1B8E\") {\n            Write-Host \"`n[+] ¡Detectada caja en Modo Amlogic WorldCup (VID_1B8E)!\" -ForegroundColor Green\n            Write-Host \"    Apagando Watchdog, desbloqueando U-Boot (lock=10100000), activando OTG y saltando a Fastboot...\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n            & $UPDATE bulkcmd \"watchdog off\"\n            & $UPDATE bulkcmd \"setenv lock 10100000\"\n            & $UPDATE bulkcmd \"setenv otg_device 1\"\n            & $UPDATE bulkcmd \"saveenv\"\n            & $UPDATE bulkcmd \"fastboot\"\n            Start-Sleep -Seconds 1\n            continue\n        }\n\n        # Canal 2: Recovery Fastbootd (PID_4EE7 desde 'Enter fastboot' en TV) o U-Boot Fastboot (PID_0D02)\n        if ($st.FastbootDevices.Count -gt 0 -or $st.RawPid -eq \"4EE7\" -or $st.RawPid -eq \"0D02\") {\n            $isUserspace = & $FASTBOOT getvar is-userspace 2>&1\n            if ($isUserspace -match \"yes\" -or $st.RawPid -eq \"4EE7\") {\n                Write-Host \"`n[+] ¡Detectado Recovery Fastbootd (PID_4EE7)! Saltando a U-Boot Bootloader real...\" -ForegroundColor Yellow\n                & $FASTBOOT reboot bootloader\n                Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 400\n                continue\n            }\n            Write-Host \"`n[+] ¡Caja atrapada en U-Boot Fastboot (PID_0D02)! Apagando Watchdog 14s y desbloqueando...\" -ForegroundColor Green\n            & $FASTBOOT oem \"watchdog off\"\n            & $FASTBOOT flashing unlock_critical\n            & $FASTBOOT flashing unlock\n            & $FASTBOOT oem \"setenv lock 10100000;save\"\n            & $FASTBOOT oem \"setenv otg_device 1;save\"\n            & $FASTBOOT oem \"saveenv\"\n            & $FASTBOOT getvar unlocked\n            Write-Host \"\"\n            Write-Host \"[OK] ¡Bootloader desbloqueado y Watchdog detenido! Que deseas hacer ahora?\" -ForegroundColor Green\n            Write-Host \"  [1] Flashear ahora mismo Android 12 Liberado Completo (Conservando Widevine L1 y MAC)\" -ForegroundColor Magenta\n            Write-Host \"  [2] Solo inyectar vbmeta desbloqueado + recovery desbloqueado + cache_ext4 y reiniciar\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n            Write-Host \"  [3] Dejar en Fastboot y volver al menu\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n            $next = Read-Host \"Elige 1, 2 o 3\"\n            if ($next -eq \"1\") {\n                Invoke-SafeAndroid12Flash -AlreadyInFastboot $true\n            } elseif ($next -eq \"2\") {\n                & $FASTBOOT flash vbmeta (Join-Path $FW_DIR \"vbmeta.img\")\n                & $FASTBOOT flash recovery (Join-Path $FW_DIR \"recovery.img\")\n                & $FASTBOOT erase cache\n                & $FASTBOOT flash cache (Join-Path $FW_DIR \"cache_ext4.img\")\n                & $FASTBOOT reboot\n            }\n            break\n        }\n\n        # Canal 3: ADB Activo (PID_4EE2 o Red Local)\n        if ($st.AdbDevices.Count -gt 0) {\n            if ($st.AdbDevices[0] -match \"unauthorized\") {\n                Write-Host \"[!] Acepta el cartel en la pantalla de tu TV...\" -ForegroundColor Yellow\n                Start-Sleep -Seconds 2\n                continue\n            }\n            Write-Host \"`n[+] ¡Detectada sesion ADB activa ($($st.AdbDevices -join ', '))! Ejecutando liberacion...\" -ForegroundColor Green\n            Execute-AdbPayload\n            break\n        }\n\n        Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 250\n    }\n    Read-Host \"`nPresiona ENTER para volver al menu\"\n}\n\nfunction Invoke-SafeAndroid12Flash {\n    param([bool]$AlreadyInFastboot = $false)\n    Write-Host \"\"\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Magenta\n    Write-Host \"   OPCION 2: FLASHEO SEGURO ANDROID 12 (B866V2) SIN PERDER WIDEVINE L1 / MAC   \" -Foreground